OL,3,GNEWSAHospital solar panel plans
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 600 solar panels can be
OL,7,Finstalled on rooftops at a mental
OL,8,Fhealth hospital in West Yorkshire after
OL,9,Fplanners approved the scheme.
OL,11,FThe project will see 614 panels fitted
OL,12,Fto five buildings at Fieldhead Hospital
OL,13,Fin Wakefield as part of a
OL,14,Fgovernment-backed drive to cut NHS
OL,15,Fenergy costs.
OL,17,FThe panels will be installed on the
OL,18,FHorizon Centre, Learning and Wellbeing,
OL,19,FNewhaven, Unity Centre and Ryeburn
OL,20,Fbuildings at the site, which provides
OL,21,Fmental health, drug and alcohol, and
OL,22,Flearning disability services.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
